ns on verification standards, status indicators, and workflow phases.\n        - **Importance**: Provides the framework for the entire refactoring task, including rules for component boundaries, consistency, performance, and code duplication.\n    - **/home/g/dev/local/runpod/proxy/server.py**:\n        - **Summary**: The main FastAPI application responsible for HTTP routing and orchestrating various proxy functionalities.\n        - **Key Edits**:\n            - **Import changes**: Replaced direct imports from `proxy.context_manager`, `proxy.vision_router`, `proxy.tool_parser`, `proxy.streaming` with imports from the new `proxy.services` package and `interfaces.py`.\n            ```python\n            # Old imports\n            # from proxy.context_manager import manage_context, condense_tool_responses_with_context\n            # from proxy.vision_router import (\n            #     has_image_content, extract_images_and_text,\n            #     query_vision_api, prepare_multimodal_request\n            # )\n            # from proxy.tool_parser import transform_qwen_response\n            # from proxy.streaming import stream_with_tool_transform\n\n            # New imports\n            from proxy.services.context_service import ContextService\n            from proxy.services.vision_service import VisionService\n            from proxy.services.tool_service import ToolService\n            from proxy.services.streaming_service import StreamingService\n            from proxy.services.interfaces import (\n                ContextManagerInterface,\n                VisionRouterInterface,\n                ToolParserInterface,\n                StreamingHandlerInterface\n            )\n            ```\n            - **Service Initialization**: Replaced direct service instantiation with a `ServiceManager` approach.\n            ```python\n            # Old initialization\n            # context_service = ContextService()\n            # vision_service = VisionService()\n            